# ChristadoreOS environment variables
#
# Every variable here is OPTIONAL. ChristadoreOS runs fully in local mode with no
# environment configured at all — copy this file to `.env.local` only when you
# want to turn on Google Calendar.
#
# Note: anything prefixed with VITE_ is inlined into the JavaScript bundle and
# is therefore public. Never put a client *secret* in this file. A Google OAuth
# client ID for a browser app is designed to be public; it is locked down by the
# Authorized JavaScript origins you configure in Google Cloud, not by secrecy.

# OAuth 2.0 Client ID for a "Web application" client in Google Cloud Console.
# Leave unset (or blank) and Settings will show Google Calendar as
# "Not configured" — nothing else in the app is affected.
# Example: 1234567890-abcdefghijklmnop.apps.googleusercontent.com
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
